langchain-openai injected a custom httpx transport to apply `http_socket_options`, which disables httpx's proxy auto-detection (HTTP_PROXY, HTTPS_PROXY, http_proxy, https_proxy set in environment). Set `LANGCHAIN_OPENAI_TCP_KEEPALIVE=0` or pass `http_socket_options=()` to restore default proxy behavior, or supply `openai_proxy` / your own `http_client` / `http_async_client` to take full control.
